    🔍 <b>Welcome to SpotTheSpy!</b>

    Gather your friends and dive into a collection of social deduction games built for laughter, suspicion, and clever thinking. These games are best enjoyed in good friend groups who love interactive, speech-based challenges.

    🕵️ In <b>Spot the Spy</b>, one player secretly becomes the Spy while others share a hidden word. Ask questions, listen carefully, and try to uncover who doesn’t know the secret — while the Spy tries to blend in and guess the word.

    🎭 In <b>Guess the Impostor</b>, everyone receives a question, but not all questions are the same. Players answer without knowing who got what, and then compare responses to find the impostor based on inconsistencies and intuition.

    Both games are played on a single device, passed around player by player, making it easy to start anywhere, anytime — no setup needed beyond your group.

    Get ready for deception, debates, and surprising reveals.
    .button-spy-game = 🕵️ Play Spot the Spy
    .button-impostor-game = 🎭 Play Guess the Impostor
